  "description": "SPECTER-S 4.0 — 1000W Mid-Drive Full-Suspension Fat-Tire E-Bike\nBuilt for challenging terrain and all-season exploration, the SPECTER-S 4.0 combines powerful mid-drive performance, long-travel full suspension, and wide fat-tire stability.\nThe 1000W BAFANG G510 mid-drive motor sends power through the bike’s drivetrain, while the removable 48V 17.5Ah battery provides energy for everyday riding and off-road adventures. A 140mm suspension fork, rear shock, four-piston hydraulic disc brakes, and SRAM NX 11-speed drivetrain help you stay in control across hills, loose surfaces, and uneven trails.\n1000W Mid-Drive Power\nThe 1000W BAFANG G510 mid-drive motor delivers power through the drivetrain instead of directly through the wheel. This central motor position helps distribute weight more evenly and allows the motor to take advantage of the bike’s gearing when climbing or adapting to changing terrain.\nLong-Travel Full Suspension\nA 140mm-travel EXPLORER suspension fork at the front and an AO-38RC shock at the rear work together to absorb bumps and improve wheel contact over uneven surfaces.\nThe full-suspension design helps provide greater comfort, stability, and control when riding across trails, gravel roads, and rough terrain.\n48V 17.5Ah Battery\nThe removable 48V 17.5Ah battery uses LG 3500mAh cells in a 13S5P configuration. It is designed to support the power requirements of the 1000W mid-drive system.\nOptional Secondary Battery Configuration\nAn optional 48V 5Ah secondary battery configuration uses LG 5000mAh 21700 cells and includes a Type-C output for compatible portable devices.\nThe secondary battery is an optional configuration and is not included unless specifically selected.\n26\" × 4.0\" Fat-Tire Stability\nWide Kenda K-1151 fat tires provide a larger contact area for enhanced grip and stability. They help the bike maintain control across gravel, dirt, sand, snow, and other loose or uneven surfaces.\nThe 26\" × 4.0\" aluminum rims use 12-gauge stainless-steel spokes to support the demands of a powerful fat-tire e-bike.\nSmooth SRAM NX 11-Speed Shifting\nThe SRAM NX 1×11-speed drivetrain provides a practical range of gears for climbing, cruising, and adapting to changing terrain.\nAn SRAM NX trigger shifter, NX long-cage rear derailleur, and PG-1130 11–42T cassette work together to deliver convenient and controlled gear changes. A gear-shift sensor temporarily interrupts motor power during shifting to help reduce stress on the drivetrain.\nFour-Piston Hydraulic Braking\nFront and rear HD-E620 four-piston hydraulic disc brakes are paired with 180mm rotors for controlled stopping performance.\nThe hydraulic system provides consistent braking control across changing terrain and riding conditions.\nClear, Convenient Controls\nThe handlebar-mounted BAFANG DP C018.CB display provides convenient access to riding information, pedal-assist settings, and system controls.\nA thumb throttle provides additional motor control, while the manufacturer-defined display speed limit is set to a maximum of 28 mph.\nAdventure-Ready Equipment\nThe SPECTER-S 4.0 is equipped with an aluminum rear rack, full aluminum fenders, a front light, rear safety light, adjustable kickstand, and platform pedals.\nThese practical components make the bike ready for recreational riding, trail exploration, and everyday transportation.",
